  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following is/are not correct with respect to energy of atomic orbitals of hydrogen atom?\n(A)$1 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 2 \\mathrm{p} \\lt 3 \\mathrm{~d} \\lt 4 \\mathrm{~s}$\n(B) $1 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 2 \\mathrm{~s}=2 \\mathrm{p} \\lt 3 \\mathrm{~s}=3 \\mathrm{p}$\n(C) $1 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 2 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 2 \\mathrm{p} \\lt 3 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 3 \\mathrm{p}$\n(D) $1 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 2 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 4 \\mathrm{~s} \\lt 3 \\mathrm{~d}$\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "x7BRU",
      "text": "(A) and (C) only",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
