  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For single electron species energy only depends on ' n ' (principal quantum number)\n\nSo energy of $2 \\mathrm{~s}=2 \\mathrm{p}$\nand energy of $3 \\mathrm{~d} < 4 \\mathrm{~s}$",
    "image": null
